sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Application
    participant SCTP as SCTP Engine
    participant DTLS as DTLS
    participant Peer as Remote Peer

    App->>SCTP: ILibSCTP_Send(streamId, data)
    SCTP->>DTLS: Encrypt + Frame
    DTLS->>Peer: UDP Packet
    Peer-->>DTLS: ACK / SACK
    DTLS-->>SCTP: Decrypt
    SCTP-->>App: OnData
